  (997, 'compensate', 'verb', 'c1', '7.0 - 8.0+', '/ˈkɒmpenseɪt/', '/ˈkɑːmpenseɪt/', '( to compensate somebody for something ) đền bù, bồi thường', 'to provide something good to balance or reduce the bad effects of damage, loss, etc.', 'Nothing can compensate for the loss of a loved one.', 'Không gì có thể bù đắp được sự mất mát của người thân.', ARRAY['compensate for the loss', 'compensate for']::text[], ARRAY['reimburse', 'offset', 'repay']::text[], ARRAY['wrong']::text[], '{"noun": "companion", "adjective": "comparable", "adverb": "completely"}'::jsonb, 'compensate_uk.mp3', 'compensate_us.mp3', 'Business, Trade & Finance', 'Corporate Management'),
  (998, 'compensation', 'noun', 'c1', '7.0 - 8.0+', '/ˌkɒmpenˈseɪʃn/', '/ˌkɑːmpenˈseɪʃn/', 'sự đền bù, sự bồi thường, vật đền bù', 'something, especially money, that somebody gives you because they have hurt you, or damaged something that you own; the act of giving this to somebody', 'to claim/award/receive compensation', 'yêu cầu/trao thưởng/nhận tiền bồi thường', ARRAY['to claim/award']::text[], ARRAY['recompense', 'defense', 'defence', 'correction']::text[], '{}'::text[], '{"adjective": "comparable", "verb": "compare", "adverb": "completely"}'::jsonb, 'compensation_uk.mp3', 'compensation_us.mp3', 'Business, Trade & Finance', 'Banking & Money'),
  (999, 'compete', 'verb', 'a2', '4.0 - 4.5', '/kəmˈpiːt/', '/kəmˈpiːt/', '( to compete against / with somebody in / for something ) đua tranh, ganh đua, cạnh t ...', 'to take part in a contest or game', 'The games were an outstanding success, with almost 2 400 athletes competing.', 'Thế vận hội đã thành công rực rỡ với gần 2 400 vận động viên tranh tài.', '{}'::text[], ARRAY['strive', 'contend', 'vie']::text[], '{}'::text[], '{"noun": "competition", "person": "competitor", "adjective": "competitive"}'::jsonb, 'compete_uk.mp3', 'compete_us.mp3', 'Sports, Fitness & Leisure', 'Matches & Competitions'),
  (1000, 'competence', 'noun', 'c1', '7.0 - 8.0+', '/ˈkɒmpɪtəns/', '/ˈkɑːmpɪtəns/', 'khả năng, ( competence for / as / in something ) ( competence in doing something / t ...', 'the ability to do something well', 'to gain a high level of competence in English', 'để đạt được trình độ cao về tiếng Anh', ARRAY['competence in English']::text[], ARRAY['competency', 'ability']::text[], ARRAY['incompetence']::text[], '{"adjective": "comparable", "verb": "compare", "adverb": "completely"}'::jsonb, 'competence_uk.mp3', 'competence_us.mp3', 'Academic, Research & Abstract Concepts', 'Abstract Ideas & Theories')
